# A struct may map to a class its vocabulary types as rdfs:Class (schema.org does) as well as owl:Class.
@prefix ex:    <https://hexplain.io/test/maps-to-class-valid#> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix bddo:  <https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#> .
@prefix hexplain: <https://hexplain.io/ns/core#> .

ex:Person a rdfs:Class .
ex:Place a owl:Class .
ex:PersonRecord a bddo:Struct ; hexplain:mapsToClass ex:Person .
ex:PlaceRecord a bddo:Struct ; hexplain:mapsToClass ex:Place .